# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. PRIMARY ZERO-COST LIVE METASEARCH ENGINE: Travelpayouts (Aviasales v3)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 100% Free API access for registered partners with NO per-search fees and NO credit card.
# Monetizes via 50%-70% affiliate commission split on user flight bookings.
#
# How to get your free API Token:
# 1. Register for free at https://www.travelpayouts.com (takes ~60 seconds).
# 2. In your dashboard, open "Programs" -> join "Aviasales (Flight Search)".
# 3. Under "API / Tokens", copy your API Token and Partner Marker ID.
TRAVELPAYOUTS_TOKEN=your_free_travelpayouts_api_token_here
TRAVELPAYOUTS_MARKER=your_affiliate_marker_id_here
NEXT_PUBLIC_TRAVELPAYOUTS_MARKER=your_affiliate_marker_id_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OPTIONAL SECONDARY GDS ENGINE: Duffel Flights API
